# openapi-typescript@7 declares peerDependencies.typescript "^5.x" and this app is on
# TypeScript 6. The range is stale, not a real incompatibility: the generator runs correctly
# under TS 6. `just ui-install` is `npm ci`, which re-checks peers and fails ERESOLVE without
# this. Committed rather than passed as a recipe flag so that a plain `npm ci` here behaves
# exactly like the recipe and like CI.
#
# This disables peer resolution for the whole workspace, which is a real safety net switched
# off. Remove it when openapi-typescript widens its peer range to include TypeScript 6
# (TODO.md T-106).
legacy-peer-deps=true
